      "date": "2026-02-12T13:06:24.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹48.57 (vs ₹10.78 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹48.57 (up from ₹10.78 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹23.1b (down 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹8.30b (up ₹7.15b from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 36% (up from 4.5% in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 5.5% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Construction industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 90% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 30% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
